Terminus Font 4.49.1 (https://terminus-font.sourceforge.net/), 8x16 regular
(ter-u16n.bdf) and bold (ter-u16b.bdf) BDF sources, copied unchanged from
terminus-font-4.49.1.tar.gz
(SHA-256 d961c1b781627bf417f9b340693d64fc219e0113ad3a3af1a3424c7aa373ef79).

Copyright (C) 2020 Dimitar Toshkov Zhekov, licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (OFL.TXT, Reserved Font Name "Terminus Font").

tools/bdf2c.py turns a subset of the glyphs into user/secwm/font16.h, a C
table used by the secwm compositor, its terminal and the GUI clients. The
glyph bitmaps are not modified; the generated table is not distributed as a
font under the "Terminus Font" name.
